# No credentials required.
# Interpreter that can `import Metashape` (licensed, separately installed), used by
# scripts/run_watched.py and scripts/run_gpu_pilot.py:
# BD3D_METASHAPE_PYTHON=/path/to/venv-with-metashape/bin/python
# Optional, only for the historical archive examples:
# BD3D_ARCHIVE_ROOT=/path/to/BD3D_Test_Output
# BD3D_DOG_PHOTOS=/path/to/arf-dog-photos
# Pass dataset roots explicitly with --root.
# Install the separately licensed Metashape module only in a compatible interpreter.
